      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E5C31662F0010000201090002FF0C000A4F4688AB621164C16709FF0C50F9503C5C314E0A53474E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓我賞<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一個禮物吧。<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B9362118CDE00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E00500B79AE72695427300200100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在異次元的MSBC也很大方，\n所以才會給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳<U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002>啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572875706B2151437684004D0053004200434E5F5F88592765B9FF0C000A62404EE5624D67037D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B30010000201090002554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要不要我送<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳\n很棒的東西呢？<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89814E0D89816211900100100003110000FF01014F6059B3000A5F8868D276846771897F5462FF1F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我把我對由紫小姐的異次元等級的愛，\n以及<U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002>都打包送給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211628A62115C0D75317D2B5C0F59D0768475706B2151437B497D1A7684611BFF0C000A4EE553CA001000020109000290FD6253530590017D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B3542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然是全像投影，\n但我送<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一個好東西吧。<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D67136662F516850CF62955F71FF0C000A4F466211900100100003110000FF01014F6059B34E00500B597D6771897F5427300200100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在神秘的地方從全像投影收到\n<U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002>，真是奇妙的體驗呢。",
